msgid "How the right-side panels that open when following a link are laid out. \"stack\": a resizable split where only the last N panels stay fully visible and older ones collapse into narrow spines; \"breadcrumb\": one panel at a time with a trail of the previous records; \"overlay\": fixed-width drawers over the page; \"scroll\": fixed-width panels in a horizontally scrolling row."
